[00:12.606]Morning bells ring blossom breeze sings
[00:17.863]Dancing shadows on my fingertips
[00:23.324]Pages turn slow seasons we outgrow
[00:29.292]Footsteps echo where the petals blow
[00:34.316]I paint the sky with yesterday's light
[00:37.428]Whispering wishes to satellites
[00:40.644]Will you catch them in the starlit tide?
[00:46.249]Tick-tock petals fall
[00:49.521]Moments bloom I recall
[00:52.281]Pink like dawn soft like you
[00:55.116]Déjà vu where are you?
[01:08.507]Daylight fades where the lost light bends
[01:14.186]Your shadow flickers in the afterglow
[01:19.962]Roads unwind maps we failed to find
[01:26.010]Footsteps buried in the melting snow
[01:30.755]I fold the night like a letter unsent
[01:33.955]Sealed with starlight still unspent
[01:37.042]Will you read it where the seasons bend?
[01:42.874]Tick-tock petals fall
[01:45.907]Moments bloom I recall
